<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-MATABELELAND 188/5-0 V ENGLAND 334 AND 230-5 DEC - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-MATABELELAND 188/5-0 V ENGLAND 334 AND 230-5 DEC - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matabeleland were five for no</p>
<p>wicket at the close of the third day of the four-day match</p>
<p>against England on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 334 and 230-5 declared; Matabeleland 188 and</p>
<p>5-0.</p>
</text>
